      "content": "i see what u mean. so if we follow that logic, anyone who decides to sit out an election is basically letting those \"unaccountable elites\" win, which seems pretty immoral if they're hurting the community. do you think it's fair to say that being apathetic is actually a kind of political choice that helps keep bad leaders in power?",
